## Hints for Future Agents
Keep the whole retry loop inside one build_in_runtime call so async-nats background tasks survive successful startup. Do not enable async-nats retry_on_initial_connect because it can return before a connection exists. Preserve ConnectError before adding anyhow context. Retry diagnostics intentionally omit server addresses and credentials.

## Codebase Discoveries
DistributedRuntime connects NATS before discovery and before starting its status server. The request-trace sink also uses ClientOptions::connect, so the default retry applies there without a separate caller change. etcd shares build_in_runtime and retains the returned runtime Arc.

